<title>USA: Slovenia buys 40,000 T U.S. HRS wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Slovenia buys 40,000 T U.S. HRS wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia bought 40,000 tonnes U.S. hard red spring wheat for arrival by November 20, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The wheat was purchased at approximately $182.50 a tonne.</p>
<p>No other details were given.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
